{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216220/extras/de8e7d929d45b463d4ceb9a5670c21a2.avif?t=1754875644\" width=500 height=147 /></span><br>Oliver came from a small town to the charming city of London to improve his life and financially support his mother, who had an accident months ago. There, he realized that his creative and investigative skills, which he hadn't fully used in his hometown, were much more valuable at the new newspaper, and he dove headfirst into a complex story. This story will demand so much of his abilities that, after countless extra hours, he starts interacting more with his boss, a man of few words and a dark, mysterious expression, hiding much in his past. Can he be trusted?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216220/extras/4497380be3c2bae4e205b21b585ec8d1.avif?t=1754875644\" width=500 height=147 /></span><br>My Boss Is Scaring Me is a short, linear BL game with deep reflections on life, problematic relationships, and decisions.<br>Short story, approximately 10k words.<br>Two endings, but only one decision.<br>Linear storyline.<br>Original CGs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216220/extras/3ef76a0e40a173a2eed64bc0948b3ddf.avif?t=1754875644\" width=500 height=147 /></span><br>Screenplay, artwork and development: B.G.Riccetto and M.Graymoon<br><br>General support: M.Graymoon<br><br>Backgrounds: Original VN Maker and DLCs<br><br>Sounds and Musics: Original VN Maker, Cynicmusic, Rony D.Kid and OwlishMedia<br>A special thanks to M. Graymoon for staying with me and my grandmother, who always believed in my creative ability, and now watches over me from heaven.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Vampire Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s